{"id":1140301,"chapter_id":1140301,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"狂瞳武器の黒幕を調査するために、事件関係者の取り調べを手配した。取調室に入るなり、騒ぐ声が聞こえた——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1140300},{"step":2,"speaker":"警備員","content":"「奴を捕まえろ！」「鎖だ鎖！」\n「気をつけろ！奴は人を噛むぞ！」「この野郎！痛いだろうが！」","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1140300},{"step":3,"content":"警備員たちは慌てて出口を塞いで、手に鎖を持って一人の少年と対峙していた。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1140300},{"step":4,"content":"少年は空を飛ぶかのように、取調室で彼らを素早く避けている。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1140300},{"step":5,"options":["何があった？"],"style":6,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301006,"trial_step":6,"course":3,"drawing":1140300,"choices":[{"text":"何があった？","goto":7}]},{"step":6,"speaker":"警備員","content":"そいつを鎖で縛れ！","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1140300},{"step":7,"content":"あなたの声は罵声に遮られた。混乱の最中にある取調室の中で、あなたの存在に気付いた者はいないようだ。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1140300},{"step":8,"content":"これは一体……","style":2,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1140300},{"step":9,"speaker":"警備員","content":"コンビクトS-076！椅子に戻れ！","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1140300},{"step":10,"speaker":"クズリ","content":"俺には名前がある！命令するな！","style":1,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1140300},{"step":11,"content":"少年は異常なまでの怒りを見せ、警備員に拳を振るった。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1140300},{"step":12,"content":"警備員が避けた先、あなたがクズリの視界に入った。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":240301013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1140300},{"step":13,"content":"彼は驚いて拳の方向を変えようとするが、もう遅い。","style":3,"background":1000,"log_type":1,"src_id":2